msgctxt "115\t253"
msgid "I no longer have the right to\\ntell you what to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "270\t470"
msgid ""
"But if you'll allow me, I think you should\\ntreat the Ryudo Family as your "
"home from now on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "510\t712"
msgid ""
"I can see it in you. You'd give your life\\nfor these people if it came down"
" to it, yes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "713\t761"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "762\t833"
msgid "Then I'm convinced."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "846\t1015"
msgid ""
"Go forward with the Ryudo Family and don't\\nlook back. You have my "
"blessing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016\t1063"
msgid "Pops..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064\t1308"
msgid "Mikio. Nakahara's a good man.\\nI know he'll raise you up right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1321\t1520"
msgid ""
"Besides, I'm not letting you back in the house,\\nanyway. Not till you've "
"become who you want to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1541\t1601"
msgid "Pops..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1652\t1712"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "Grazie."
